    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: c1ba0fe3ff2d0655eb4209d51ce610a63b2e7e8c -->\n### Review of #3044 at c1ba0fe3f: clean, built on the runner\n\nBuilt and tested on runner m3 with `pr-test.yml` (run\nhttps://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/44792800611 , completed\nsuccess). The review read the diff and checked the fix against #3043.\n\nWhat the change does:\n\n- `support.rs`: the timing line is now formatted into one string and\n  written to stderr with one `write_all` on the locked handle. Before,\n  `writeln!` sent the line in pieces, and a parallel case's panic\n  message could fall between them. That split line is the #3043\n  failure.\n- `contract.rs`: the contract test starts its two cases with\n  `--test-threads=1`, so they run in order. Its asserts are unchanged.\n- New pin `support::timing_line_is_one_whole_line`: it checks the exact\n  line text and that the line holds one newline.\n\nCheck of the laws:\n\n- Test-only change; no G-code, geometry, or posting code moves. Not\n  under the safety floor.\n- `Changelog: none` is right for a test-support change.\n- The fixing commit ends with `Fixes #3043`.\n- The provenance comment of the suite stays accurate.\n\nNo blocking items. The PR is a draft; flag it ready and a collaborator can\nmerge it. Labels are not touched by this review.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
